  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light traveling in water is incident on the boundary between water and air. The angle between the incident rays and the boundary is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\alpha\"></span>. The critical angle is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta_{c}\"></span>. Which diagram correctly shows the path of the rays when <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\theta_{c} &lt; \\frac{\\pi}{2} - \\alpha\"></span>?</p>\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
